       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIGNLEADINGDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PLAIN-SIGNED PIC S9(4) VALUE -125.
       01 LEADING-SIGN PIC S9(4)
           SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE VALUE -125.
       01 TRAILING-SIGN PIC S9(4)
           SIGN IS TRAILING SEPARATE VALUE -125.
       01 DISPLAY-BUFFER PIC X(6).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "PLAIN (internal sign): " PLAIN-SIGNED
           MOVE LEADING-SIGN TO DISPLAY-BUFFER
           DISPLAY "LEADING SEPARATE:      " DISPLAY-BUFFER
           MOVE TRAILING-SIGN TO DISPLAY-BUFFER
           DISPLAY "TRAILING SEPARATE:     " DISPLAY-BUFFER
           STOP RUN.
